  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a>的附加模組增強了</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/botanydev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">botanydev</a>建築模組中的戰利品系統：<br></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory: Towers</a></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰利品將有更多變化，並從相似的原版戰利品表中選取，這些戰利品表也包含模組物品以確保與所有添加戰利品的模組兼容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅需安裝在伺服器端，無需所有模組同時存在。</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前無已知兼容性問題，應可與其他模組共同運作。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p>若您喜歡此模組，請考慮支持開發，任何形式的支持都將不勝感激。</p><p>本模組為無償的業餘開發項目，您的支持能讓我投入更多時間進行開發。<br>您可以在Patreon上贊助我，或協助宣傳此模組。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
